/a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc17aba569f6d394\" href=\"?note=cc17aba569f6d394\" title=\"43-thm-mlrandom-kolm\">43-thm-mlrandom-kolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Proposition 11.1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"252"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"272"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_c\">\\(\\mathcal R_c\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7449d7fd44914a58\" href=\"?note=7449d7fd44914a58\" title=\"43-df-low-high\">43-df-low-high</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c4064bf070958ca9\" href=\"?note=c4064bf070958ca9\" title=\"43-df-randomness-layers\">43-df-randomness-layers</a>；低基定理与随机点复杂度刻画见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"95e37bd44b042dee\" href=\"?note=95e37bd44b042dee\" title=\"43-thm-basisthm\">43-thm-basisthm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cc17aba569f6d394\" href=\"?note=cc17aba569f6d394\" title=\"43-thm-mlrandom-kolm\">43-thm-mlrandom-kolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Low}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Low}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书证明是将低基定理应用于一个非空的有界亏损层。前缀复杂度刻画使每条路径均随机。核对了此短证明的组合；没有重证低基定理本身。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Proposition 11.1.2；印刷页252，PDF页272。核对了本条所述短证明组合；底层定理证明并非全部重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"7449d7fd44914a58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-randomness-layers","status":"resolved","id":"c4064bf070958ca9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-randomness-layers]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-basisthm","status":"resolved","id":"95e37bd44b042dee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-basisthm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-mlrandom-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"cc17aba569f6d394","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-mlrandom-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{Low}$、$\\mathcal R_c$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-low-high]]、[[43-df-randomness-layers]]；低基定理与随机点复杂度刻画见 [[43-thm-basisthm]]、[[43-thm-mlrandom-kolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-low-high","status"